  "prefLabel": "Agr 901.01 Apples",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 901.01 Apples. Requirements for production, sale, and marketing of apples in New Hampshire shall be as those promulgated by the U.S. Department of Agriculture under Title 7 CFR Part 51, Subparts B and C.\n\nSource. #4067, eff 6-5-86; ss by 4547, eff 12-16-88, EXPIRED: 12-16-94\n\nNew. #6170, eff 1-24-96, EXPIRED: 1-24-04\n\nNew. #14550, eff 4-1-26, EXPIRES: 4-1-36",
